// Shared.xcconfig
// FocusBorder
//
// Build settings that are safe to publish. Signing identity deliberately is not:
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is per-developer, and a committed value signs every clone with
// somebody else's team.
//
// Your own team goes in Config/Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored. The include below
// is optional (`#include?`), so a fresh clone with no Local.xcconfig still configures
// and builds — it just produces an unsigned build until you supply a team.
//
// Config/Local.xcconfig.example shows the one line it needs.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
